@include ../../shared/squash.overtone

## Backhand three-shot sequence
Backhand three-shot sequence, five minutes. Straight drives in turn first. Soft, on the service
line, bouncing in the service box. Medium, a racket head above it, bouncing behind the box. Then
hard, just under the service line, so it comes off the back wall. Halfway, drive, volley and drop.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 5:00
0:00 [go]
8% Soft. Medium. Hard.
25% Same preparation every time. Only the swing speed changes.
38% Hard one off the back wall? Then it's right.
50% Now drive, volley, drop. Drive from behind the short line, step in and volley the return, then drop the next one short. Pick it up, and go again.
63% Volley it softer, so it comes back short enough to drop.
76% Racket up between every shot.
88% Stay low and still for the drop.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]
